blocks.en:
Claim 5 warned that the aspects we remove may interact with traversal, and studying that interaction requires a setting in which they are present.
The definition already provides one ( C.1 );
rather than supplying 𝒲 \mathcal{W} anew for each instance, fix it and learn it during training. 𝒢 \mathcal{G} then resides in the weights rather than in the context, providing the in-weights setting .

